<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3790"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 08, 2005 - 5:03 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I´m sorry if this has been posted before. <BR>Researching I found this information about Douglas Mould. It appears that he is a sex therapist. <BR>Maybe BTK was his patient? <BR>Maybe BTK got angry at DM, and killed his wife as a punishment? <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.google.dk/search?q=cache:bhrGsABgDagJ:archive.aclu.org/court/williamsvpryor_memo.html%2B%22Douglas%2BMould%2B%22&amp;hl=en" target=_top>http://www.google.dk/search?q=cache:bhrGsABgDagJ:a rchive.aclu.org/court/williamsvpryor_memo.html&#43;%22 Douglas&#43;Mould&#43;%22&amp;hl=en</a> <BR> <BR> Relying extensively on the testimony of Dr. Douglas Mould, a state certified psychologist and sex therapist,<!--/Text--></td></tr>
