<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3794"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 08, 2005 - 6:33 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I found this on the net, and in the same post Carol Mould name is mentioned.  <BR>My problem is that the text in the post seems to bee som kind of code or just rubish. <BR> Due to that english is NOT my first languish please somone read the link and tell me what you think? <BR>Also not that this post was posted 2004-09-02 wich means 20 days before Carol Mould was killed. <BR>In that post there is also a link to a porn rape site: <BR> <BR><a href="http://groups.google.dk/groups?hl=en&amp;lr=&amp;threadm=ubng9sihjy8mxdlazczpgqasvjh5o%404ax.com&amp;rnum=29&amp;prev=/groups%3Fq%3D%2522carol%2BMould%2522%26start%3D20%26hl%3Den%26lr%3D%26selm%3Dubng9sihjy8mxdlazczpgqasvjh5o%25404ax.com%26rnum%3D29" target=_top>http://groups.google.dk/groups?hl=en&amp;lr=&amp;threadm=u bng9sihjy8mxdlazczpgqasvjh5o%404ax.com&amp;rnum=29&amp;pre v=/groups%3Fq%3D%2522carol%2BMould%2522%26start%3D 20%26hl%3Den%26lr%3D%26selm%3Dubng9sihjy8mxdlazczp gqasvjh5o%25404ax.com%26rnum%3D29</a> <BR> <BR>Another thrust – another pain… <BR>Another scream… she lungs – in vain…  <BR>Another drop of blood – another flash of passion… <BR>Another hoarse moan – your full, complete obsession… <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
