<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3797"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 08, 2005 - 6:58 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Here are som more posts,It sounds like from the same kind of people: <BR> <BR><a href="http://groups.google.dk/groups?q=%22carol%2BMould%22&amp;start=20&amp;hl=en&amp;lr=&amp;selm=51ED9785.83E78EEE%40YGEVTIK.IA.US&amp;rnum=30" target=_top>http://groups.google.dk/groups?q=%22carol&#43;Mould%22 &amp;start=20&amp;hl=en&amp;lr=&amp;selm=51ED9785.83E78EEE%40YGEVT IK.IA.US&amp;rnum=30</a> <BR> <BR>why did Carol mould towards all the codes?  We can&#39;t burn dryers unless Willy will deeply comb afterwards <BR> <BR><a href="http://groups.google.dk/groups?q=%22carol%2BMould%22&amp;start=40&amp;hl=en&amp;lr=&amp;selm=1aq6ir%241hy%247%40att.net&amp;rnum=45" target=_top>http://groups.google.dk/groups?q=%22carol&#43;Mould%22 &amp;start=40&amp;hl=en&amp;lr=&amp;selm=1aq6ir%241hy%247%40att.ne t&amp;rnum=45</a> <BR> <BR>What did  <BR>Carol mould outside all the sauces?  We can&#39;t arrive frames unless  <BR>Peter will lovingly waste afterwards.   <BR> <BR>Plenty of inner full sauce nibbles raindrops before Petra&#39;s abysmal  <BR>code. <BR>---  <BR> <BR>NOTE that the name Petra is also mentioned in this post. <BR> <BR>I´m NOT saying thise posts are related to either the Carol mould case OR BTK but I would like somone from US to take a look at this posts to deside what its all about. <BR> <BR>skov <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
