<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3875"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Analyzer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Analyzer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 10, 2005 - 8:29 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I may be wrong however I suspect that he was once associated with The School of Medicine Wichita based on the following item. <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.webs.wichita.edu/wcpip/AlumniList.html" target=_top>http://www.webs.wichita.edu/wcpip/AlumniList.html</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
