<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3879"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Jabez<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Jabez<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 10, 2005 - 10:02 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->You are correct-I have viewed that website but it never occured to me what exactly it was.  I wonder if it is unusual for University of Texas students to do an internship in another state?  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
