<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5451"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Analyzer<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Analyzer<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 30, 2005 - 3:05 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I wouldn&#39;t call <BR> <BR>&#34;Butler County Sheriff Craig Murphy says as far as they know, there is no connection between the death of Carol Mould and the BTK investigation&#34; <BR> <BR>as clearing BTK.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
