<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5583"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Verm_inve<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Verm_inve<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->8-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 1:33 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I&#39;ve never felt that Carol Mould was a true BTK victim.  I&#39;ve mentioned her being in an article where the BTK was mentioned &#40;which got this thread started.  And there is of course the location of her murder to the 8th drop-off ... but nothing jumps out and says &#34;BTK!!!&#34; <BR> <BR>What I think is interesting though is the connection, very small connection, to Barbra Smith&#39;s murder.  Another murder that I believe has nothing to do with the BTK.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
