<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6336"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 06, 2005 - 7:51 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->For a very long time I have had this VERY strong intuitive feeling that BTK was/is? a patient of  <BR>D Mould. <BR> <BR>I don´t think D Mould knows that BTK was/is? his patient but I think that BTK killed Moulds wife because of somthing connected to his status as a patient of D Mould.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
