<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6359"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Q<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Q<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 06, 2005 - 2:03 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Nadeltanz, <BR> I&#39;m not sure what first question you mean and have no idea how it is that I got it... <BR> <BR>As for the map question to Analyzer... what you said doesn&#39;t answer my question at all because your explination doesn&#39;t address my question at all... but thanks for the effort. <BR> <BR>Not trying to be rude i just don&#39;t understand your point&#40;s&#41; <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
